      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GSearchInputModels = {\n  /**\n   * @description binding value\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  modelValue?: string; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GSearchInputProps = {\n  /**\n   * @description placeholder text for the input\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  placeholder?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description label text for the input\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  label?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description help text displayed below the input\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  helpText?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description error message to display\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  messageError?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description debounce time in milliseconds\n   * @default 300\n   */\n  debounceTime?: number;\n  /** @description whether the component is disabled */\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  /** @description whether the component is in loading state while fetching initial data */\n  initialLoading?: boolean;\n  /** @description whether the component is in loading state while searching */\n  searchingLoading?: boolean;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GSearchInputEvents = {\n  \"update:modelValue\": [value: string];\n  search: [value: string];\n  clear: [];\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type GSearchInputExposed = {\n  focus: () => any;\n  blur: () => any;\n  clear: () => void;\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
